# ── Dev API domain (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────
# When unset, the app falls back to http://localhost:8080/api (or
# http://10.0.2.2:8080/api on the Android emulator) — see client/lib/api.ts.
# On Replit, this is injected automatically by the `dev` script from
# $REPLIT_DEV_DOMAIN and does not need to be set here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_DOMAIN=
